# --- Python ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/

# --- Virtual environments (any subfolder, any common name) ---
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/ENV/
**/.virtualenv/

# --- Secrets / config (any subfolder) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets.*

# --- IDE / editor ---
.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# --- OS cruft ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# --- Node (in case any subproject uses it) ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Generated at runtime (keep a sample copy for the deliverable instead) ---
**/inventory.db
**/audit.log
**/audit.log.*
**/audit.jsonl
**/run.log
**/agent.log
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/logs/*.log
!**/logs/.gitkeep
